/-!
# Fröberg's prediction through twice the generating degree

`Froberg.paperStatement` proves that every positive generating degree has a variable
threshold valid for all infinite fields and every generator count. The assertion concerns
the actual homogeneous pieces of the polynomial quotient, through degree `2 * d`.
The quadratic case includes characteristic two and its checked finite certificates.
-/
